                  <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-orange-400">
                    IvyTicketing War Engine v2.4
                  </span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
                  <span>Room ID:</span>
                  <span class="text-white font-bold" id="room-id-label">WAR-BOS-2026</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- DYNAMIC CONTENT (Controlled by Client Script) -->
              <div id="console-body" class="relative z-10 py-6 sm:py-8">
                <!-- Default Connecting State -->
                <div class="text-center space-y-4">
                  <div class="inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/15 animate-spin text-2xl text-[#fdda24]">
                    ⏱️
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold uppercase text-white">Menghubungkan ke Ruang Antrean...</h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Memeriksa status otentikasi atlet dan antrean aktif.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Security Reassurance Footnote -->
              <div class="relative z-10 border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-xs text-slate-400 space-y-2">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold shrink-0">✓</span>
                  <span>Posisi antrean Anda terikat dengan token sesi terverifikasi. Halaman akan otomatis memperbarui nomor urut tanpa perlu memuat ulang (refresh) browser.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-[#fdda24] font-bold shrink-0">⏱️</span>
                  <span>Saat giliran tiba, audio bel akan berbunyi dan Anda akan diberikan jendela waktu 10 menit untuk melengkapi tiket dan formulir atlet.</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Real-Time War Protocol Guidelines -->
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/60 p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-3">
              <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#fdda24] flex items-center gap-2">
                <span>📋</span>
                <span>Protokol Keamanan & Keadilan Antrean (Fair Play)</span>
              </h3>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
                <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-950/70 p-3 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
                  <span class="font-bold text-white block">1. Satu Perangkat, Satu Kuota</span>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Membuka beberapa tab dengan akun yang sama tidak akan mempercepat posisi dan berisiko membatalkan sesi.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-950/70 p-3 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
                  <span class="font-bold text-white block">2. Jendela Checkout Terbatas</span>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Setelah masuk ke formulir, kuota slot Anda ditahan (reserved) selama 10 menit untuk proses pengisian data.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-950/70 p-3 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
                  <span class="font-bold text-white block">3. Anti-Bot Verification</span>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Sistem otomatis mendeteksi script calo dan memblokir IP yang melakukan request tidak wajar.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-950/70 p-3 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
                  <span class="font-bold text-white block">4. Pembayaran Multi-Channel</span>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Mendukung QRIS Dinamis instan, Virtual Account bank nasional, dan kartu kredit resmi berizin BI.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- RIGHT COLUMN (5 Cols): Live Category Quotas & Telemetry -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
            
            <!-- Live Quota Availability Card -->
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-slate-900/90 p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-4 shadow-xl">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-3">
                <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white flex items-center gap-2">
